Consider leaving this in main inventory. It is great for engraving the E
word should that be necesary (non-cursed athames can engrave the whole word
in one turn, and do not dull). It's also lovely when you find any liches or
golden nagas, as it will eat those malignant aura curses they so like to
throw at you. The reduction in killing speed (which won't be reduced THAT
much, since you will have your silver sabre working offhand) is worth the
protection.

